OL,3,ACanada becoming EU 'associate member'
OL,4,Awould be positive move, Carney says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPM Mark Carney says he "welcomes" the
OL,7,FEU's "ambition" for Canada to become an
OL,8,Fassociate member
OL,10,FHe makes the remarks in a speech to the
OL,11,FEuropean Parliament - here's what else
OL,12,Fwe heard
OL,14,FSpeaking to reporters afterwards,
OL,15,FCarney says a closer alliance with the
OL,16,FEU is a "positive process", and will
OL,17,Fmake his country a "more effective
OL,18,Fpartner" of the US
