OL,3,ACanada becoming EU 'associate member'
OL,4,Awould be positive move, Carney says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe adds that nobody is going to tell
OL,7,FCanadians "what language we speak,
OL,8,Fno-one is going to dictate our culture,
OL,9,For with whom we can strike agreements
OL,10,Finternationally"
OL,12,FUS President Trump earlier threatened
OL,13,Ftariffs on Europe and called the idea
OL,14,Fof Canada becoming the bloc's first
OL,15,Fassociate member "laughable"
OL,17,FThe US recently increased tariffs on
OL,18,FCanadian goods, with Canada responding
OL,19,Fwith tariffs of its own
